# Play test of Kelpdeep Rock (CIPlay kelpdeep_rock, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe ("offset").
# The survey hut on the north-east islet (13..17.5 27.5..32, floor 5.2 m), the buoy and its recorder at 8 14, the four
# kelp caves 11-12 m down: north (-6 24), east (30 6), south (2 -22), west (-20 8), their posts 3 m south of each.
island Kelpdeep Rock
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Under the Kelp
wait 5
expect animals Turtle 2
expect animals Dolphin 2
at 15.25 29.5 h=6
zone hut
expect step 0
read Survey orders
expect step 1
open Survey hut box
open Survey chest
expect message Four readings first
at -6 22 h=-9
use post1
air air1
zone air1
expect step 2
at 30 4 h=-9
use post2
air air2
use post2
expect message You have this cave's reading
at 2 -24 h=-8
use post3
at -20 6 h=-9
use post4
expect story reading 4
expect step 3
at 8 12.5 h=0.5
use recorder
expect message SURVEY COMPLETE
at 15.25 29.5 h=6
open Survey chest
expect done
open Sunk survey barrel
